  "sourceUrl": "https://openplatform.byd.com/#/document/index?id=237",
  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>『倍轻松』颈部按摩仪</strong></span></h1><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1. 车机联动功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">倍轻松颈部按摩仪通过蓝牙协议接入“智慧物联APP”</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，用户通过车机大屏或者车内语音助手，实现对颈部按摩仪传统艾灸、艾灸碳、光疗、大师模式、放松模式、开肩模式等功能。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/fba83a68cd714bba92873e5227e21154.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-6f8b2af4fa3a4a0080456d445cff582d-0-b311dcf19f8e35431893e080fc29d73439ecef9c093f9715592968157e2ffbbb\" alt=\"车机大屏操控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 421.00px;height: 689.50px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-1 颈部按摩仪车机联动</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px;\"><strong>1.1 车机大屏控制</strong></span></h3><ul><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">模式支持“开肩”、“混合”、“热灸”三种模式切换；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">手法替换支持“混合”、“拔筋”、“活力”、“硬核”；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">按压支持“低挡”、“中挡”、“高挡”三挡调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">热敷支持“关闭”、“低挡”、“高挡”三档调节；</span></li><li style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">定时设置支持多种时间段；</span></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/836cfbfd35fd41e5afc60d30ac1318f5.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-f49ae7a2557d420fbf5ce3c51d5c303c-0-0714e028c9db9d8a5ee1f7cabf388f8652594a3064313b58f2f01adf9c87691b\" alt=\"设备-243-首页-颈部按摩仪-上滑2-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 726.00px;height: 408.38px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-2 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制1</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/ec5d5cf3bbad41c4ad57392c10dd89ac.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-39d5045de9054ab1a145eb51a1213c75-0-0479b5269bf63bea95fd11ad3e9801bcfce07aa9dd043c99df235e5e8f7b575e\" alt=\"设备-244-首页-颈部按摩仪-上滑-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 722.00px;height: 406.13px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-3 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制2</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/352287f2f98a4ac783a7a4e91f63e70b.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-1033b676545d49819f189bdefe68dc30-0-d79ba208df5affe0ba9fc26f48a48d0c944b290612b3cfe1d58bb0332937289f\" alt=\"设备-246-首页-颈部按摩仪(1)-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 718.00px;height: 403.84px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-4 颈部按摩仪车机大屏控制3</span></p><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1.2 车机语音功能</strong></span></h3><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机智能语音实现了车机大屏控制颈部按摩仪的全部功能。方便用户解放双手，畅享按摩。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">车机端语音控制说明提供了操控该设备的语控提示词，如</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-6。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e047e01a88544d93bf9d5fb6d94efd9b.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-a22aac59d9fa449da7d1f183cbfd8239-0-d8284faf7a3c3c256d7ce83947453571ae82d72e2db80cb67a61e40ef3cd7e11\" alt=\"语控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 436.00px;height: 694.42px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-5 颈部按摩仪车机语控</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/e227404f6b7645e69121ed1b83719bc9.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-72daf2443e744a9f858859cd6a3e4202-0-95eb3e0a55f7ec1d31f92f0d48586940dd9de869d19e8bd0aaf1184f11aef58b\" alt=\"设备-100-首页-颈部按摩仪-语音控制说明-缩小.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 726.00px;height: 408.38px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 1-6 颈部按摩仪车机语控说明</span></p><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 20px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2. 手机控制功能</strong></span></h2><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">颈部按摩仪离开车机的使用场景中，手机也可控制按摩仪的功能。从手机端比亚迪App的\"我的-&gt;智慧物联\"，添加颈部按摩仪，进入按摩仪的控制界面，该界面可显示并控制颈部按摩仪剩余电量、热敷模块状态、按压调节和剩余时间、当前模式等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/7f389406c3bd46af92133d800e7f2203.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-5908f7a3a4284421a54a7e45104d52e6-0-e0c23fa03929fb61f0c10e6a91b2274b278a76d0bb048c72b2ac906fa3b09cde\" alt=\"手机操控.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 430.00px;height: 725.89px;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/9fde5bd04415436a8eb5abd34b844fa3.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-26b5c1abe1f446f4abd05eb1006c3803-0-f1d272fa8fe3a754d7f923ac4a8520bb1afa29b460bb9dd348c52632741d923d\" alt=\"缩小比例.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 335.97px;height: 728.20px;\"> <img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/a6271d7d5d9046eda6daa0f1c2f84671.jpg?auth_key=1795678278-6a9b03d542324426afe4afc1bf9d5a12-0-fa921c2fdaf51ba7c67eca738e75a5b99d106a1e4aa88a848c7d0f8c08cbf6ae\" alt=\"缩小2.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 335.97px;height: 728.20px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 15px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图 2-1 手机端操控颈部按摩仪</span></p>"
}
